Claude outputs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- answer keys
# These carry the reference decisions the second annotator and the second coder
# are asked to reproduce. Publishing them would void the agreement study, and
# this is a public repository. Both are regenerable from committed scripts, so
# nothing is lost by excluding them:
#   origin_key.csv            <- evaluation/build_annotation_bundles.py
#   taxonomy_restructured.md  <- analysis/taxonomy_restructure.py
# The BLANK artefacts are released and stay tracked: the annotation bundles
# (no in_ground_truth column) and analysis/taxonomy_coding_sheet.csv.
evaluation/annotation_round1_key/
analysis/taxonomy_restructured.md

# Annotator pack archives, rebuilt by build_annotation_bundles.py
evaluation/*.zip

docs/paper_notes.md
